00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:53.160
<v Mike>So, look, this was a arcade game made by SNK and they did make the NES port, too.

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:59.480
<v Mike>But it was an arcade game made in 1987 using the same name, Touchdown Fever.

00:16:59.980 --> 00:17:06.940
