00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:10.080
<v Mike>So, they do make that distinction over there.

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:18.460
<v Mike>And then it finally reaches the NES in February of 1991, where it's probably, like, you know, too late.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:20.420
<v Mike>We've seen a lot.

