00:17:47.180 --> 00:18:05.960
<v Mike>Yeah. And, of course, worth remembering that, you know, like, even comparing it to 10-yard fight is generous because in 1987, when SNK released Touchdown Fever, Tecmo released in 1987 in arcades, Tecmo Bowl.

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:10.520
<v Mike>So, you know, it was just never really a good time for SNK.

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:17.360
